T                            ! Modified set of CDI-NSE coupling  (F-Original , T-Modified)
T                            ! Use alternative solver (F-Frantzis (2019), T - Alternative)
1.0    1.0                   ! lower bound restriction of GAMMA and EPSILON (CDI interface parameters) for adaptive timestepping
T     0.7 0.7 0.7            ! Use phase chnage module? and what is the phase chnage factor?
F     0.0007                 ! Trigger 3D output after constant time intervals?
randomNucleationSites.in     ! specify name of input file for bubble nucleation sites
P P  N N  N N                ! x-component BC for reg term  (value is always zero)
P P  D D  N N                ! y-component BC for reg term  (value is always zero)
P P  N N  D D                ! z-component BC for reg term  (value is always zero)
2   0.0001  T                ! outflow direction (0=no outflow), outflow region length, forced convection flow?
0   1.0   0.03  18  0.16  4  ! cyclic bc with PI flow controller: dir bulk_vel cyclic_length  start_integral   i_value  p_value
smag F F F F T F             ! LES: SGS model, and which wall is actually a wall? (-1 1 -2 2 -3 3)
